    "·" : {
      "comment" : "A period used to separate two related items or concepts.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "(%lld)" : {
      "comment" : "A label showing the number of items or entries related to a specific module in the search results. The argument is the count of results for that module.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "**%@**: %@" : {
      "comment" : "A list item displaying an attachment ID and the item ID it is associated with. The argument is the attachment ID, and the second argument is the item ID.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**%1$@**: %2$@"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "**%1$@**: %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ %@" : {
      "comment" : "A section header displaying the name of a module and its corresponding icon. The first argument is an SF Symbol. The second argument is the name of the system image that represents the module. The third argument is a foreground color that matches the tint color of the module.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld: %@ -  %@ - %@ %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$lld: %2$@ -  %3$@ - %4$@ %5$@"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$lld: %2$@ -  %3$@ - %4$@ %5$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adventure missing" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Abenteuer fehlt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "As an observer you can join any hosted game in the local network. All observers does not have a player pin nor dice to roll. They are invisible and show only the game view without any interaction in the game." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Als Beobachter kannst du einem Lokalen Spiel beitreten. Die Beobachter sehen die Würfel, Karte, Bilder und hören die Musik. Sie können nicht würfeln und haben keinen Marker auf der Karte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attachments in Shareplay" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Anhang in SharePlay"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Abbrechen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel Game" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spiel abbrechen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wählen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect to: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Verbinde zu: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conntect as proxy to extent your game view. The proxy will be acting as the same player as it is connected to. It can be use as second screen and as a sceond audio source. That has the advantage to have a const volume for the music during the game. On a shareplay device the music get ducked by the facetime environment." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eine Erweiterungsverbindung ermöglicht es dir deinem Spiel Lokal beizutreten. Damit kannst du den Spielschirm erweitern. Auf der Erweiterung kannst du alles machen wie in der direkten Verbindung. Du hast einen zweiten Würfel, den die anderen Spieler als deine sehen. Du kannst die Karte und Bilder sehen und die Musik hören. Dies ist besonders geeignet in einem SharePlay Spiel damit die Musik weiterhin im Hintergrund mit der gleichen Lautstärke abgespielt wird."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Demo" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Demonstration"
          }
        }
      }
    },
